# Production default for the demo: run on sample Idaho data.
#
# This is committed on purpose. Until there is a real course list and a Supabase
# project, a deployed build has nothing to connect to, and the point of the demo
# is that Mark can open a link and click around. Without this, a fresh deploy
# shows the "missing configuration" screen instead of the app.
#
# To point a deployment at the real directory, set VITE_USE_MOCK=false in the
# Vercel project's environment variables (that overrides this file) along with
# VITE_API_BASE_URL and VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY.
VITE_USE_MOCK=true
